    {
      "name": "@pcmid/dsh-auto-restart",
      "title": {
        "en": "Auto restart",
        "zh": "自动续跑"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "When the Harness quits, restarts, or crashes while an agent is working, continues those conversations after the next startup. Waits for subagents that were cut off too, rearms active goals, and stops after a few automatic continuations without your input.",
        "zh": "agent 运行中 Harness 被退出、重启或崩溃时，下次启动后自动继续这些会话。子 agent 被中断也会唤醒主会话，活跃的 goal 会重新启用；你没有发消息时，连续自动续跑超过几次就不再续跑。"
      },
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
      "author": "pcmid",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/pcmid/dsh-plugins/tree/main/plugins/dsh-auto-restart#readme",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/pcmid/dsh-plugins",
        "directory": "plugins/dsh-auto-restart"
